@baseUrl = https://nxguard.local:8443/nxg

### Teste 1: GET com corpo (Body Content)
# Dispara a regra OWASP CRS 920170: "GET or HEAD Request with Body Content"
GET {{baseUrl}}/ HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 30

{
  "test": "trigger body on get"
}

### Teste 2: SQL Injection simples na Query String
# Dispara regras OWASP CRS 942xxx (SQLi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/?id=1'%20OR%20'1'='1 HTTP/1.1
Host: nxguard.local:8443

### Teste 3: Path Traversal / Local File Inclusion (LFI)
# Dispara regras OWASP CRS 930xxx (Path Traversal)
GET {{baseUrl}}/?file=../../../../etc/passwd HTTP/1.1
Host: nxguard.local:8443

### Teste 4: Remote Code Execution / Command Injection
# Dispara regras OWASP CRS 932xxx (RCE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/?cmd=;cat%20/etc/passwd HTTP/1.1
Host: nxguard.local:8443

### Teste 5: Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)
# Dispara regras OWASP CRS 941xxx (XSS)
GET {{baseUrl}}/?q=<script>alert(1)</script> HTTP/1.1
Host: nxguard.local:8443

### Teste 6: User-Agent Malicioso / Scanner
# Dispara regras OWASP CRS 913xxx (Scanners)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ HTTP/1.1
Host: nxguard.local:8443
User-Agent: sqlmap/1.7
